igned}\n$$" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411266 1068 #edb/ref 17592186411258 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411266 1069 "q-105108" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411266 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411266 1071 "Let $v=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ and $w=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].$ What is $(2v)\\cdot w?$" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411266 1072 #uuid "16324101-11ba-5ac3-b499-b08b32289ecb" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411266 1074 "First, multiplying each component of $v$ by $2$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2v & =2[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}14 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(2v)\\cdot w & =14\\cdot 1+4\\cdot (-5)+6\\cdot 4+8\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =14-20+24-40 \\\\  & =-22\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411267 1068 #edb/ref 17592186411254 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411267 1069 "q-34163" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411267 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411267 1071 "If $b=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ and $c=[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$, then $b\\cdot c=$" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411267 1072 #uuid "535d2613-b3a1-5204-b804-20416fe47ef7" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17592186411267 1074 "To compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot c & ={b}_{1}\\cdot {c}_{1}+{b}_{2}\\cdot {c}_{2}+{b}_{3}\\cdot {c}_{3}+{b}_{4}\\cdot {c}_{4} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 3+4\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =12-4+3+4 \\\\  & =15\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534129 17592186045417 true] [17